      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    weight_1 = 0.40\n    weight_2 = 0.60\n    std_deviation_1 = 0.30\n    std_deviation_2 = 0.15\n    correlation = 0.25\n\n    # Calculate portfolio variance\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        (weight_1 ** 2 * std_deviation_1 ** 2)\n        + (weight_2 ** 2 * std_deviation_2 ** 2)\n        + (\n            2\n            * weight_1\n            * weight_2\n            * correlation\n            * std_deviation_1\n            * std_deviation_2\n        )\n    )\n\n    # Calculate portfolio standard deviation as a percentage\n    portfolio_standard_deviation = (portfolio_variance ** 0.5) * 100\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(portfolio_standard_deviation, 3)\n```",
